          "title": "A Different Way of Learning",
          "status": "published",
          "passageTitle": "A Different Way of Learning",
          "passageHtml": "<p><br></p><p>Carlos decided to improve his English because he wanted to communicate more confidently at work. He enrolled in an online course that allowed him to study whenever he had free time. At first, he found it difficult to follow the lessons and complete the exercises regularly. However, he soon developed a study routine and began practicing every evening.</p><p>The course included reading activities, listening exercises, and opportunities to speak with other students. Although he sometimes made mistakes, he understood that these were part of the learning process. After six months, Carlos noticed that he could understand conversations more easily and express his ideas more clearly.</p><p>He now recommends online learning to his colleagues because it offers flexibility and encourages personal responsibility.</p>",
          "passageText": "\nCarlos decided to improve his English because he wanted to communicate more confidently at work. He enrolled in an online course that allowed him to study whenever he had free time. At first, he found it difficult to follow the lessons and complete the exercises regularly. However, he soon developed a study routine and began practicing every evening.\nThe course included reading activities, listening exercises, and opportunities to speak with other students. Although he sometimes made mistakes, he understood that these were part of the learning process. After six months, Carlos noticed that he could understand conversations more easily and express his ideas more clearly.\nHe now recommends online learning to his colleagues because it offers flexibility and encourages personal responsibility.\n",
